Today is Saturday.
I have work at the café this morning.
So, I wake up very early.
Tommy also wakes up with me.
Now it is time for his breakfast.
Anitha brought his dry food yesterday.
I must measure that food correctly.
I put the food in his bowl.
"Tommy, come here!" I call him.
He eats it very quickly.
Then, I eat my breakfast.
I am eating a dosa.
Tommy looks at my plate.
He slowly comes near me.
But I remember Anitha's rule.
I must not give him food from my plate.
"No Tommy, stay away," I tell him firmly.
He listens and goes to his bed.
Before going to the café, we must go for a walk now.
